#: user_guide/api_relaunch.rst:1
msgid "API hot replacement"
msgstr "API 熱替換"

#: user_guide/api_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS, ``xinference-supervisor`` can replace its API process "
"while preserving the Supervisor, Workers and model processes. The public "
"address stays the same. New connections enter the replacement; existing "
"requests and streams finish on the previous API."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 和 macOS 上，``xinference-supervisor`` 可以替換 API 程序，同時保留 "
"Supervisor、Worker 和模型程序。對外位址維持不變。新連線進入替換後的 API，既有請求與串流在原 API 上完成。"

#: user_guide/api_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"Send ``POST /v1/api/relaunch`` or run ``xinference relaunch-api``. These "
"operations require an administrator session when authentication is enabled. "
"The optional ``python_executable`` selects an absolute Python path on the "
"Supervisor machine; that environment must already contain a compatible "
"Xinference installation. Omit it to reuse the currently serving API's "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"傳送 ``POST /v1/api/relaunch`` 或執行 ``xinference relaunch-"
"api``。啟用身分驗證時，這些操作需要管理員工作階段。選用的 ``python_executable`` 指定 Supervisor 所在機器上的絕對"
" Python 路徑，該環境必須已安裝相容的 Xinference。省略時重用目前提供服務的 API 環境。"

#: user_guide/api_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"The HTTP 202 response contains an ``operation_id``. Poll ``GET /v1/api-"
"relaunches/{operation_id}`` or list operations with ``GET /v1/api-"
"relaunches``. States are ``starting``, ``switching``, ``draining``, "
"``succeeded`` and ``failed``. ``draining`` means the new API is serving "
"while the previous API finishes admitted requests."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 202 回應包含 ``operation_id``。輪詢 ``GET /v1/api-"
"relaunches/{operation_id}``，或透過 ``GET /v1/api-relaunches`` 列出操作。狀態為 "
"``starting``、``switching``、``draining``、``succeeded`` 或 "
"``failed``。``draining`` 表示新 API 已提供服務，舊 API 正在完成已接收的請求。"

#: user_guide/api_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"A failed startup leaves the previous API serving. Reuse ``request_id`` when "
"retrying the same request. Only one replacement may run at a time. Operation"
" history belongs to the stable service host and lasts until it stops. Local "
"mode, Windows, Supervisor upgrades and database migrations are outside this "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"啟動失敗時，原 API 繼續提供服務。重試相同請求時重用 "
"``request_id``。同時只能執行一次替換。操作歷程屬於穩定的服務宿主，保留至宿主停止。本操作不包含本機模式、Windows、Supervisor"
" 升級或資料庫遷移。"
